WEBVTT

00:15:27.479 --> 00:15:30.379
De er nuværende medlemmer af 
Flying machine Arena research team.

00:15:30.379 --> 00:15:35.148
(Bifald)

00:15:35.148 --> 00:15:38.194
Federico Augugliaro, Dario Brescianini , 
Markus Hehn,

00:15:38.194 --> 00:15:41.018
Sergei Lupashin, Mark Muller and Robin Ritz.

00:15:41.018 --> 00:15:42.950
Hold øje med dem. De er bestemt til store ting.

00:15:42.950 --> 00:15:44.128
Tak.

00:15:44.128 --> 00:15:50.482
(Bifald)